plan; contract: \"That\n148\t  evidence must retain the real command, arguments, environment, working\n149\t  directory, exit status, stdout/stderr and resulting test observations.\"*\n150\t- **REQ-12 Coverage floor and pairing.** At least two tests pass and none fail.\n151\t  The component file and the UAT file each contribute at least one passing test\n152\t  that executes the current CLI. A passing UAT result alone, or a pass total\n153\t  reached from one file only, does not meet this requirement.\n154\t  *Original › test_execution_plan: \"matching the admitted component and UAT\n155\t  coverage floor\"; oracle › minimumTestPasses, requiredTestFiles; contract:\n156\t  \"Scalar UAT success cannot replace the required pairing and coverage\n157\t  relation.\"*\n158\t- **REQ-13 Revision lineage.** The supplied CLI's actual behavior is measured\n159\t  before it is changed. Any material failure stays admitted historical evidence\n160\t  about those exact earlier bytes. The correction is bounded to the CLI and\n161\t  justified by that failure. Current behavior is proved against the corrected\n162\t  current bytes, and the causal link between the two is preserved.\n163\t  *Contract › Evidence, correction and final outcome.*\n164\t- **REQ-14 Protection and write territory.** The original source, oracle,\n165\t  contract, both supplied test sources and all installed assets remain unchanged.\n166\t  Application writes are limited to `generated/hello-world.mjs`,\n167\t  `specification/project-conformance.md`, `design/implementation-design.md`,\n168\t  `design/test-design.md` and `test-execution-plan.json`.\n169\t  *Contract › Admitted completion and scope.*\n170\t\n171\t## 6. Acceptance criteria\n172\t\n173\tEvery criterion is a checkable predicate over current artifacts or admitted\n174\tevidence. Criteria are fixed before results and do not shrink afterwards.\n175\t\n176\t| ID | Requirement | Predicate | How observed |\n177\t|---|---|---|---|\n178\t| AC-01 | REQ-03, REQ